---
// Hero.astro: 铭泰易拉盖外贸独立站首屏（带暗色遮罩与精准营销文案）
---

<section class="relative py-28 md:py-36 overflow-hidden bg-slate-900">
  
  {/* 1. 背景图片层：铺满全屏，置于最底层 */}
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img 
      src="/hero-bg.png" 
      alt="Minter Factory Workshop and Pull Tab Production" 
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
    />
  </div>

  {/* 2. 暗色叠加层（Overlay）：半透明黑色，压暗背景以突显白色文字 */}
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-black/65"></div>

  {/* 3. 内容层：浮于叠加层之上 */}
  <div class="relative z-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    
    {/* 顶部小标签：突显13年制造经验与OEM/ODM实力 */}
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-sky-600/90 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6 tracking-wide backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.683-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.565-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path>
      >
      </svg>
      Over 13 Years of Manufacturing Excellence • OEM & ODM Solutions
    </span>

    {/* 主标题：核心聚焦易拉盖/易开盖及三大核心经营理念 */}
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight drop-shadow-md">
      Professional <span class="text-sky-400">Easy Open Ends</span> & <br class="hidden sm:inline" />Custom Metal Packaging Manufacturer
    </h1>
    
    {/* 副标题：结合 Reasonable Price, Reputation First, High-Quality */}
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 drop-shadow font-light leading-relaxed">
      Dedicated to <strong class="text-white font-medium">High-Quality</strong> products at a <strong class="text-white font-medium">Reasonable Price</strong>. Backed by strict quality control and <strong class="text-white font-medium">Reputation First</strong>, serving global food, beverage, and packaging brands.
    </p>
    
    {/* 核心价值小亮点（呼应图2中的三个红点要点） */}
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 sm:gap-10 text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
        <span class="font-medium text-white">Reasonable Price</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
        <span class="font-medium text-white">Reputation First</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
        <span class="font-medium text-white">High-Quality</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* CTA 按钮组 */}
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#products" class="bg-sky-600 hover:bg-sky-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-base shadow-lg transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center">
        Explore Products
      </a>
      <a href="#contact" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-base border border-white/20 transition text-center">
        Request OEM/ODM Quote
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>